[Debug] ----- Vuln Cause Analysis -----
The potential vulnerability is related to Command Injection. This vulnerability arises because the application accepts user-supplied input for the `command_regex` parameter without adequate validation or sanitization. If this input is directly used to construct system commands, an attacker could manipulate the input to execute arbitrary commands on the server, leading to unauthorized access or control over the system. The reliance on user-defined regular expressions to filter processes can be exploited if the application does not properly restrict or validate the input, thereby compromising the security of the server.

